          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "The sav and doc data files have been deposited by the depositor, the por, dta and pdf files have been derived from the originals by DANS.\n\nPlease note:\n\n* The data file \"Textese_Language_EF_measures_corrected.sav\" has been replaced by a corrected version on May 24 2016. The incorrect version, and its versions in por and dta are no longer accessible. \n\nIt concerns errors in the following columns:\n- SES\n- Words\n- Words_utterance\n- Messages_total\n- Tot_utt\n- Om_ratio\n- Om_ratio_2outl\n- Ratio_Type\n- Ratio_Spel\n\n* The folder 'Corrections Tables article 10.1371/journal.pone.0152409 - June 2016' has been added on June 13, 2016. It contains replacements for the tables in the PlosOne article:\nChantal N. van Dijk, Merel van Witteloostuijn, Nada Vasić, Sergey Avrutin, Elma Blom, 'The Influence of Texting Language on Grammar and Executive Functions in Primary School Children'. PLOS, published: March 31, 2016. DOI: 10.1371/journal.pone.0152409 (Available through: http://dx.doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0152409 )"
